From `D16tab` and `TRtab`.  `SKtab` (rows `lo = 0..10`, `W = 0..96`): the largest value of a sequence with
`lo .. 10` links within weight `W`; `RHtab`: the largest value of a ring within `W` holes; `NRtab`, `NStab`
(`n = 0..4`), `NXtab` (`n = 0..5`, 5 = at least 5): the largest total value of `n` items of positive value
(rings; sequences that borrow nothing; any) within the item weight `W`; `NA2tab`: two sequences that borrow
a class; `NS1tab`: a sequence with at least one link and a sequence.  Nothing is assumed about them:
`A16Arith.lean` checks every property used.
